Package: fieldtrial
Title: Parameter Sets, Trait Trade-Offs and Environmental Drivers for the 'plant' Model
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "Falster", , "daniel.falster@unsw.edu.au", c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9814-092X"))
    )
Description: Sets up runs of the plant forest model by bundling a site's
    environment with a species' trait trade-offs and parameter sets. Holds
    named parameter sets for species and sites, the functions that derive
    model parameters from traits, and adapters that turn gridded and
    flux-tower climate into the daily driver series plant reads.
